{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026apdufF2mYh1793615883.jpeg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>中原地產九龍豪宅高級分區經理麥少基表示，分行最新促成一宗何文田文福道德威大廈成交，單位為低層B室，實用面積727平方呎，採三房兩廁間隔，座向東北方，外望街景，最新以820萬元易手，折合實用呎價11279元。</p><p> </p><p>中原地產麥少基指，原業主早於1985年僅以63.5萬元購入上址，持貨已經41年，現轉手賬面可獲利756.5萬元離場，單位期內升值近12倍。</p><p> </p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T07:02:01.694551+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":173,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T06:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T08:18:22.635703+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T06:58:48.984074+00:00","content_hash":"ef57108fdf5d52da0510361143d2c94219dbdb9fad9c0e0abe4c3b7a9250d9a1","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T07:02:01.694551+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}